<title>RUSSIA: Russian May inflation 14.6 pct yr/yr from 15.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Russian May inflation 14.6 pct yr/yr from 15.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's consumer price inflation slowed in May to a record low 14.6 percent year-on-year, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN CONSUMER PRICES    MAY 97    APR 97    MAY 96</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	 +0.9	+1.0	+1.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +14.6     +15.3     +58.5</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
